{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HMUR is a high-speed retro first-person shooter that combines the hardcore action of Hotline Miami, the high-tech Soviet setting of Atomic Heart, and Dusk's intense gunplay. Every move is your chance to survive, every stop is a ticket to oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/c64620a66000cfff83cefc3864eb1651.poster.avif?t=1774116510\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/c64620a66000cfff83cefc3864eb1651.webm?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/c64620a66000cfff83cefc3864eb1651.mp4?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life, endless attempts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, you learn to be more precise, faster, and more careful. The stakes are high - a single hit can bring death to either you or the enemy. Take advantage of all your mobility in order to become part of this endless dance with death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival relies heavily on firearms, and sometimes you come across weapons of great power. But remember - each bullet is a valuable resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are non-linear structures in which choosing a path directly impacts the flow of the game. Having trouble with one path? Pick another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world will speak if you are ready to listen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interested in finding out what's going on? Learn more about the facility and its destruction by exploring levels, finding clues, audio recordings, and other details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/b3ab77f1721961778a827824ad8f8889.poster.avif?t=1774116510\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/b3ab77f1721961778a827824ad8f8889.webm?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/b3ab77f1721961778a827824ad8f8889.mp4?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD OF THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action unfolds in an alternate 1990s version of USSR. The city of Mirnogorsk is located in the depths of Khakassia, a city that is the pride of the Union, a center of innovation and progress. The high-tech facilities of this city embodied the vision and hopes for a bright future of every citizen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, a tragic accident turned the pride of the Soviet Union into chaos, bringing the protagonist, Sergei, into the center of it. A mere utility worker with a challenging fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/582e6370d3db347eee528dace55928f2.poster.avif?t=1774116510\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/582e6370d3db347eee528dace55928f2.webm?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/582e6370d3db347eee528dace55928f2.mp4?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and meaty gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels with branching paths where the choice can affect the walkthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large arsenal of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack combining techno, hard bass, and breakcore.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499560?t=1774116510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774116510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/4c894dca942ac0999ebf4f79a5c51a562fd2049a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774116510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/4c894dca942ac0999ebf4f79a5c51a562fd2049a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774116510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Graphic depictions of violence such as decapitations, severed limbs, exploding bodies. Alcohol, profanity."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HMUR is a high-speed retro first-person shooter that combines the hardcore action of Hotline Miami, the high-tech Soviet setting of Atomic Heart, and Dusk's intense gunplay. Every move is your chance to survive, every stop is a ticket to oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/c64620a66000cfff83cefc3864eb1651.poster.avif?t=1774116510\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/c64620a66000cfff83cefc3864eb1651.webm?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/c64620a66000cfff83cefc3864eb1651.mp4?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life, endless attempts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, you learn to be more precise, faster, and more careful. The stakes are high - a single hit can bring death to either you or the enemy. Take advantage of all your mobility in order to become part of this endless dance with death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival relies heavily on firearms, and sometimes you come across weapons of great power. But remember - each bullet is a valuable resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are non-linear structures in which choosing a path directly impacts the flow of the game. Having trouble with one path? Pick another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world will speak if you are ready to listen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interested in finding out what's going on? Learn more about the facility and its destruction by exploring levels, finding clues, audio recordings, and other details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/b3ab77f1721961778a827824ad8f8889.poster.avif?t=1774116510\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/b3ab77f1721961778a827824ad8f8889.webm?t=1774116510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc